  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Water Works is Kansas City's scenic showcase — a wooded course with serious elevation changes and skyline views of downtown and the Missouri River. A brand-new layout opened here in August 2024, mixing long open holes with short, precise ones across 6,131 feet at par 56.",
    "Free to play with concrete tees and Mach X baskets, it's the city course where the views are as memorable as the golf. Some of the elevation changes are genuinely extreme, so bring grippy shoes and a camera.",
    "The 2024 redesign gave Kansas City a modern flagship — and the skyline backdrop makes it the best-looking round in town."
  ],
