  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 11 is the longest at Water Works at 499 feet — a par 3 that climbs with the course's biggest elevation change while the Missouri River glints below. It's the hole that defines the 2024 redesign: long, scenic, and far more demanding than the par number suggests.",
